    "summary": "递推公式、错位相减、裂项相消。",
    "content": "<div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，今日为师传你 <b>《数列综合》</b>，属于<b>选必二·4.数列</b>，推衍宫核心心法。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧮 一、引道·数学精髓</h3><p>递推公式、错位相减、裂项相消。</p><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">师姐，数学最难的是……不知道从哪下笔。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">记住入门第一句——<b>a_{n+1}=a_n+f(n)：累加</b>。数学讲究\"先识别模型\"，模型对了，公式就自然出现。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📖 二、拆经·五大要点</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ a_{n+1}=a_n+f(n)：累加</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ a_{n+1}=a_n·f(n)：累乘</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 错位相减：等差×等比</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 裂项：1/(n(n+1))=1/n-1/(n+1)</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 数学归纳法</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📐 三、图解·核心公式</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fc,#dde8f8);border:1px dashed #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#2a4a7e\"><b>📜 1/(n(n+1))=1/n-1/(n+1)</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fc,#dde8f8);border:1px dashed #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#2a4a7e\"><b>📜 1/(n(n+2))=½(1/n-1/(n+2))</b></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🔥 四、演道·经典例题</h3><p>S_n=1/(1·2)+1/(2·3)+...=n/(n+1)</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">💬 五、对话·师徒印证</h3><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">数学最容易失分在<b>数学归纳法</b>——注意数式变形和代入的顺序。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">如果我做题时想不到用哪个公式呢？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">先看题目<b>结论要求什么</b>，倒推需要哪些量；再看<b>已知条件</b>，看能提取什么关系。中间用适当的公式桥接。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">再补一心法：<b>见到未知，尝试设元；见到条件，尝试联立；见到不等，尝试构造函数</b>——三种反射一旦形成，数学半座山已经翻过。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎯 六、印证·真题范式</h3><p>本篇高考真题围绕 <b>a_{n+1}=a_n+f(n)：累加</b> 与 <b>a_{n+1}=a_n·f(n)：累乘</b>。<br>解题步骤：<br>① 识别模型 → ② 选公式 → ③ 代入计算 → ④ 检验答案。</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7fc833,transparent);border-left:5px solid #4a7fc8;color:#2a4a7e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧘 七、参悟·记忆口诀</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fc,#dde8f8);border:1px dashed #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#2a4a7e\"><b>📜 数列综合要牢记，1/(n(n+1))=1/n-1/(n+1)；先识题再选式，代入验证保得分！</b></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，数学之道，重在\"熟练+审题\"。多做题、多总结、多归纳！</span></div>",
